## 8. CHANGELOG

**文件**：`CHANGELOG.md`

遵循 [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) 格式 + [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/)。

```markdown
# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- Prettier + ESLint 前端代码规范
- rustfmt 后端代码规范
- CI/CD workflow（typecheck + format + lint + test）
